==Battleground==
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zapy]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zoge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Li'l Zyclone]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**3 [[Zapy|Zapies]] spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the amount of Zapies here, it's recommended to have 2 meatshields and to build an offensive force before hitting the base to prematurely end the stage to avoid having to invest more valuable anti-Zombie units. Alternatively, this is one of the best stages to invest [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] into due to his tanking prowess against even multiple Zapies.

